{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Joyal 范畴 Θn"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Joyal范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Joyal 范畴 $\\Theta_n$ 的对象是"},{"Local":{"url":"探测","text":"探测"}},{"Plain":" $(\\infty,n)$-范畴的基本单元, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>归纳定义</h3>\n<p>记 $\\Delta$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":", $\\Gamma$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal范畴Γ","text":"Segal 范畴 $\\Gamma$"}},{"Plain":", 有典范的函子 $\\gamma\\colon \\Delta\\to\\Gamma$; 详见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal函子γ","text":"Segal 函子 $\\gamma$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. Joyal 范畴 $\\Theta_n$ 是 $n$ 个 $\\Delta$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"圈积","text":"圈积"}},{"Plain":", 带有典范函子 $\\Theta_n \\to \\Gamma$.</p>\n<p>该定义出自 "},{"Local":{"url":"BergerWr","text":"Berger"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>通过组合 $n$-圆盘</h3>\n<p>范畴 $\\Theta_n$ 可通过 Joyal 的 “"},{"Local":{"url":"组合圆盘","text":"组合 $n$-圆盘"}},{"Plain":"” 直接定义.</p>\n"}]}}